    "name": "Hanno",
    "steam_appid": 2851120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851120/extras/5ccae01124495f311d5de54d2e3d3d98.avif?t=1746528166\" width=620 height=132 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hanno is a visually captivating action-adventure game that blends fluid combat, story-driven exploration, and light puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the fictional world of Ashar, the player takes on the role of Vimal, an orphaned teenager from a small village who stumbles upon Hanno \u2013 an unusual baby elephant \u2013 alone and wounded in the forest. As Vimal, players must uncover the mystery behind Hanno, while battling the Asuras, malevolent creatures that have suddenly corrupted the boy\u2019s world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An elephantastic bond</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the wonder of having a baby elephant companion: bond with Hanno and use his magical powers in combat and puzzle-solving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Asuras</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face fantastical foes, each with unique attack patterns and vulnerabilities - yet all united by a common goal - as you prepare for unexpected challenges in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize or save enemies and upgrade your skills across two paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ashar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lush tropical regions, ancient forests and sacred temples of Ashar, filled with secrets and collectibles. Uncover a forgotten legend, for it holds the key to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items to customize Hanno.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The boy and the elephant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a heartfelt tale of growth, courage, and discovery \u2013 one that will stay with you long after it ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2851120/extras/5ccae01124495f311d5de54d2e3d3d98.avif?t=1746528166\" width=620 height=132 /></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hanno is a visually captivating action-adventure game that blends fluid combat, story-driven exploration, and light puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the fictional world of Ashar, the player takes on the role of Vimal, an orphaned teenager from a small village who stumbles upon Hanno \u2013 an unusual baby elephant \u2013 alone and wounded in the forest. As Vimal, players must uncover the mystery behind Hanno, while battling the Asuras, malevolent creatures that have suddenly corrupted the boy\u2019s world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An elephantastic bond</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the wonder of having a baby elephant companion: bond with Hanno and use his magical powers in combat and puzzle-solving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Asuras</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face fantastical foes, each with unique attack patterns and vulnerabilities - yet all united by a common goal - as you prepare for unexpected challenges in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize or save enemies and upgrade your skills across two paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ashar</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the lush tropical regions, ancient forests and sacred temples of Ashar, filled with secrets and collectibles. Uncover a forgotten legend, for it holds the key to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items to customize Hanno.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The boy and the elephant</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a heartfelt tale of growth, courage, and discovery \u2013 one that will stay with you long after it ends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Fate brings together Hanno, an unusual baby elephant, and Vimal, an orphaned teenager, as they face a supernatural menace that threatens their world. They will bond as friends, fight and explore as one, and uncover the true cost of loyalty in this stunning and heartfelt action-adventure game.",
